('m3m-residences-by-elie-saab','ES-2','101',41,'C','W','{"morning":0,"cool":5,"vastu":60,"view":75,"airflow":92,"floor":98}'::jsonb,'{"overall":"West-facing is neutral. Bedrooms in the west are acceptable; the living area can be balanced with lighter north-east furnishing.","rooms":{"entrance":{"dir":"SE","score":2,"ideal":"NE","reason":"The main door is most auspicious in the NE, N or E (the Ishan–Kuber arc); W and NW are workable; S, SW and SE entries are cautioned and rely on remedies."},"living":{"dir":"W","score":3,"ideal":"NE","reason":"Living room in the NE or north draws prosperity; seating should face east or north. Keep the NE corner light and uncluttered."},"masterBed":{"dir":"NW","score":3,"ideal":"SW","reason":"Master bedroom in the SW (earth zone) promotes restful sleep and stability. Sleep with head pointing south or east."},"kitchen":{"dir":"E","score":2,"ideal":"SE","reason":"Kitchen belongs in the SE (Agni corner); south works, NW is a fallback. NE or north kitchens set fire and water energies in conflict."},"bed2":{"dir":"SW","score":4,"ideal":"W","reason":"Secondary bedrooms suit the west or south — stable, with afternoon light. NE is acceptable for unmarried children."},"bed3":{"dir":"N","score":4,"ideal":"NW","reason":"Guest and children’s rooms suit the NW (Vayu zone). Children sleep with head to the south or east; avoid the SE for kids."},"pooja":{"dir":"NE","score":5,"ideal":"NE","reason":"Puja room belongs in the NE (Ishan kona) — the most sacred zone. Deity faces east or west; the devotee faces east or north."},"bathroom":{"dir":"E","score":2,"ideal":"NW","reason":"Toilets belong in the NW or west. The NE (Ishan kona) must never host a wet area; SW toilets weaken household stability."}}}'::jsonb,'{"lake":false,"corner":false}'::jsonb,'{"sun_winter_h":4.080509,"sun_am_h":0,"sun_pm_h":4.080509,"rank":{"overall":10,"of":12,"morning":7,"cool":7,"vastu":4,"view":7,"airflow":1,"floor":1},"weakest_dim":"morning"}'::jsonb),
